OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer's pride at 'forever'
OL,4,Abook
OL,5,
OL,6,FLooking at the old camera in his hands,
OL,7,FVictor Wedderburn can hardly believe
OL,8,Fphotographs he took more than 40 years
OL,9,Fago are finally being made into a book.
OL,11,FBack then Wedderburn, now 71, could not
OL,12,Fafford a new Praktica (MTL5) SLR camera
OL,13,Fand had to scrape together the money to
OL,14,Fbuy his second hand.
OL,16,FHe had just been made redundant from
OL,17,Fhis lorry driver job of 10 years, so
OL,18,Fmaking ends meet was his first
OL,19,Fpriority.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
