OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer's pride at 'forever'
OL,4,Abook
OL,5,
OL,6,FWedderburn set about photographing his
OL,7,Ffriends and neighbours in Manningham,
OL,8,FBradford, then an area home to a large
OL,9,FCaribbean migrant population.
